&_nc_oc=Ado8HgHDExrBaVe5D2-rAVZV84nEukY7cG7wtSHRo6Yxeb2KVcD5hOR7Ix34cMHSPSo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCNZmvuxjRoh4Tz7RaU_ip-vYB8dCvDfwKhjnUsfF-TDg&oe=6A6B6ABE"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DGwIqvDPBncQ7kNvwFomt4L&_nc_oc=AdrncjXjftXoLIGOHGMxVyjkuK9FiWrWgS5xZuiYJ4ptCE3q-e1wMIo4eZx0mj_3Yb0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC878is7ZTEb913uw5GnKlZK0m0T26YRDpL5_7a4uv5mA&oe=6A6B437C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8Ej--5gCSvcQ7kNvwHovixI&_nc_oc=Adop7FA9E7EZVqDGjdYimxtRIahIl836b8eP8W52_ss0jrBEtiKmaLDQ-i8RaG2K1aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBP2L9_HO26Q8qTvhzowZC35pWX_U-mT3LfHngq86yaRQ&oe=6A6B6207"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lvd1WVK7HEEQ7kNvwG0zyn0&_nc_oc=AdpZlE84L6Q3ML16hFIg7zgOhflbPXg5qQh0A_ywzY5HtkgyUlZJzkafDwLucQO6dYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQAG0G_rw6uDasGTa4fOBKYR75CKP5tR5PdSsOunoZQ9MQ&oe=6A6B4DD5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MUBxx9Bow0gQ7kNvwFyFYl7&_nc_oc=AdqtR9Hp725EndInfdO4wVoan3c6ZMU6gwezkacCWIqUu8U2WFnx5sFfARjX_UJUJE0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQABCDqvd-YQgcWJVDDR5Hu2cBdR60gTzdZgi0sgTjSzpw&oe=6A6B5A64"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.