id=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Gchok6v2mEIQ7kNvwFSJl69&_nc_oc=AdocFuiRcy58be41Q2jUk3BgI-elxJmSU4BlhSNORS57A6Yhyrhhm_tHVDNQIaCtMKs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQBZ2FgUjA3zfsv-Jb0jKGnUP30O0PjgR30clykX-tbQTA&oe=6A6B3DA4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_meta-store_Trailer-Cover-Image.png", "id": "6477503358931451", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222937_6477503362264784_6203451220098661937_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kzlo0j318X8Q7kNvwFvjLUs&_nc_oc=AdrkYN6E3N_6mqj6a78GaPM1ycn0HryfNK8KOM6igh3TmeXcGkDfq4YjekoNBO_0C1E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDmrybJo7I2FBEt8toTvXQaE2Vi8xC4Tc1pOLHD9OrBQQ&oe=6A6B3AF1"}, "display_name": "Flipside Studio", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "cartoon", "streaming"], "long_description": "Turn any room into a stage with Flipside Studio!\n\nPacked with features, Flipside Studio is a virtual production studio that allows creators to use VR to make real-time animated shows for Twitch, YouTube, TikTok, and more.\n\nShare your live-streamed or recorded adventure, comedy, family entertainment or talk show series\u2026Your only limit is your imagination!\n- Choose from pre-loaded characters, sets, and 100's of props\n- Create characters in-app using Ready Player Me\n- Use show tools like cameras, teleprompters, monitors, slideshows, and more\n- Capture actor and prop movement as full spatial motion capture recordings that can be seen from any angle\n- Create on your own or collaborate remotely in-real time with folks world-wide\n- Stream online, on social, Zoom, and more with the free Flipside Broadcaster (PC) companion app\n- Customize characters, sets, props and effects with the free Unity plug-in, Flipside Creator Tools\n\nDownload Flipside Studio today. Visit www.flipsidexr.com for free tools and tips.\n", "short_description": "Turn any room into a stage with Flipside Studio!\n\nPacke